    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: The cross is carved in a niche, and the two wings have two triple-loops.
    the moddle loop is stretched and has a form of a flower bud taht gives a blossoming
    and vegetative appearance to the cross. the two little crosses on the right and
    the left parts of the central cross symbolize the two bandits crucified witht
    the Christ. On the right and the left sides of the main cross, as well inteh
    corners of the niche the artist carved angles. the details of the little crosses
    ore carved like braid, and teh wings are copped with double buttons khachkar
    has a unique rostte it's, The cross is carved in a niche, and the two wings have
    two triple-loops. the moddle loop is stretched and has a form of a flower bud
    taht gives a blossoming and vegetative appearance to the cross. the two little
    crosses on the right and the left parts of the central cross symbolize the two
    bandits crucified witht the Christ. On the right and the left sides of the main
    cross, as well inteh corners of the niche the artist carved angles. the details
    of the little crosses ore carved like braid, and teh wings are copped with double
    buttons khachkar has a unique rostte with the same ornaments on both right and
    left sides.
